{"unit":3,"section":1,"cefr":"Intro","objective":"learn the alphabet","skill":"Letters 3","heading":"Learn the alphabet","phrases":[{"he":"הילדה אוכלת תפוז.","en":"The girl is eating an orange.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/a617e0083e654b3c4349119a51a65305","tokens":[{"w":"הילדה","h":["the girl is","the girl"]},{"w":"אוכלת","h":["is eating","eating","are eating"]},{"w":"תפוז","h":["an orange","orange"]}]},{"he":"הילד לא רוצֶה מים.","en":"The boy doesn't want water.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/6e83c844cbbef009206fb617c2f09862","tokens":[{"w":"הילד","h":["the boy","the boy is","the kid"]},{"w":"לא","h":["doesn't","didn't","does not"]},{"w":"רוצֶה","h":["want","wants","would like"]},{"w":"מים","h":["water"]}]},{"he":"הוא רוצֶה עוגה ואני רוצֶה תפוח.","en":"He wants a cake and I want an apple.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/078800337586d2e29aaec92e1e3f73b1","tokens":[{"w":"הוא","h":["he","(he) is","him"]},{"w":"רוצֶה","h":["want","wants","would like"]},{"w":"עוגה","h":["a cake","cake"]},{"w":"ואני","h":["and I","and I am"]},{"w":"רוצֶה","h":["want","wants","would like"]},{"w":"תפוח","h":["an apple","apple"]}]},{"he":"התפוח טעים.","en":"The apple is tasty.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/6f1930282cf781c05d4d99b3aa3c3196","tokens":[{"w":"התפוח","h":["the apple is","the apple"]},{"w":"טעים","h":["tasty","delicious"]}]}],"sentences":[{"he":"רע","en":"bad","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"מיץ","en":"juice","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"עוף","en":"a chicken","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"מתוק","en":"sweet","alt":[],"t":"a"},{"he":"תפוז","en":"an orange","alt":[],"t":"a"},{"he":"חמוץ","en":"sour","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"עצוב","en":"sad","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"תפוח","en":"an apple","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"אפרסק","en":"a peach","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"עיתון","en":"a newspaper","alt":[],"t":"a","inferred":1},{"he":"התפוז.","en":"The orange.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התפוח.","en":"The apple.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה כיף!","en":"This is fun!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה תפוז.","en":"This is an orange.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"זה הספר.","en":"This is the book.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"זה חמוץ.","en":"It is sour.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"זה עצוב.","en":"It is sad.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"זה תפוח.","en":"This is an apple.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני עצוב.","en":"I am sad.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני קורא.","en":"I am reading.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה התפוז.","en":"This is the orange.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה התפוח.","en":"This is the apple.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"זה עיתון.","en":"This is a newspaper.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"ספר עצוב.","en":"A sad book.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"היא קוראת.","en":"She is reading.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הילד קורא.","en":"The boy is reading.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הכלב יפֶה.","en":"The dog is pretty.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המלך קורא.","en":"The king is reading.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הספר יפֶה.","en":"The book is nice.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"תפוח יפֶה.","en":"A pretty apple.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התפוח חמוץ?","en":"Is the apple sour?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התפוח מתוק.","en":"The apple is sweet.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"כן, זה כיף.","en":"Yes, this is fun.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"האוכל טעים.","en":"The food is tasty.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"האישה קוראת.","en":"The woman is reading.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הילדה קוראת.","en":"The girl is reading.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה ספר יפֶה.","en":"This is a nice book.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא בוס טוב.","en":"He is a good boss.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"זה עיתון רע.","en":"This is a bad newspaper.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"כן, זה הספר.","en":"Yes, this is the book.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני אוכל עוף.","en":"I am eating chicken.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הוא קורא ספר.","en":"He is reading a book.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"תפוז או תפוח?","en":"An orange or an apple?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני קורא ספר.","en":"I am reading a book.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני אוכל עוגה.","en":"I am eating a cake.","alt":["I eat a cake."],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני אוכל תפוז.","en":"I am eating an orange.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני אוכל תפוח.","en":"I am eating an apple.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני קוראת ספר.","en":"I am reading a book.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני רוצֶה ילד.","en":"I want a boy.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני רוצֶה מים.","en":"I want water.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני שותֶה מיץ.","en":"I am drinking juice.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתה אוכל תפוז.","en":"You are eating an orange.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתה אוכל תפוח.","en":"You are eating an apple.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הגבר קורא ספר.","en":"The man is reading a book.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התפוז לא מתוק.","en":"The orange is not sweet.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"לא, זה לא כיף.","en":"No, this is not fun.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"תפוח או אפרסק?","en":"An apple or a peach?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני אוכלת עוף.","en":"I am eating a chicken.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"זה אפרסק מתוק.","en":"This is a sweet peach.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני קורא עיתון.","en":"I am reading a newspaper.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני רוצֶה עוגה.","en":"I want a cake.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני רוצָה תפוח.","en":"I want an apple.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הילד רוצֶה ספר.","en":"The boy wants a book.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התפוז או התפוח?","en":"The orange or the apple?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני אופֶה עוגה.","en":"I am baking a cake.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני רואָה עוגה.","en":"I see a cake.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הגבר אוכל תפוח.","en":"The man is eating an apple.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"זאת תקופה יפָה.","en":"It is a pretty period.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"האבא אוכל אפרסק.","en":"The dad is eating a peach.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האישה רוצָה לחם.","en":"The woman wants bread.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הילדה קוראת ספר.","en":"The girl is reading a book.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני קוראת עיתון.","en":"I am reading a newspaper.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הילדה רוצָה חלב.","en":"The girl wants milk.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הילדה אוכלת תפוז.","en":"The girl is eating an orange.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/a617e0083e654b3c4349119a51a65305"},{"he":"הילד לא רוצֶה מים.","en":"The boy doesn't want water.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/6e83c844cbbef009206fb617c2f09862"},{"he":"הוא עצוב ואני שמח.","en":"He is sad and I am happy.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"היא רוצָה את היין.","en":"She wants the wine.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"זאת עליית גג יפָה.","en":"This is a pretty attic.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"היא אוכלת עוף ולחם.","en":"She is eating chicken and bread.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני אוכל תפוז טעים.","en":"I am eating a tasty orange.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אני אוכל תפוח חמוץ.","en":"I eat a sour apple.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הדבורה אוכלת אפרסק.","en":"The bee is eating a peach.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"היא קוראת ספר יפֶה.","en":"She is reading a nice book.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"הגבר אוכל תפוז יפֶה.","en":"The man is eating a pretty orange.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני שותֶה בקבוק מיץ.","en":"I am drinking a bottle of juice.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"האישה רואָה גבר יפֶה.","en":"The woman sees a handsome man.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הילדה אוכלת לחם מתוק.","en":"The girl is eating sweet bread.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הילדה שותָה מיץ מתוק.","en":"The girl is drinking sweet juice.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתה רוצֶה מיץ או מים?","en":"Do you want juice or water?","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"גרמניה היא מדינה יפָה.","en":"Germany is a beautiful country.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"עוגה טעימה, היא טעימה.","en":"Tasty cake, it is tasty.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני לא רוצֶה תפוח חמוץ.","en":"I don't want a sour apple.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני רואֶה ילד אוכל תפוח.","en":"I see a boy eating an apple.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני רוצָה אפרסק או תפוז.","en":"I want a peach or an orange.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אני רוצֶה לברוח לשירותים.","en":"I want to run away to the restroom.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"המהנדס קורא את הספר בדקה.","en":"The engineer reads the book in a minute.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אני רעב, אני רוצֶה שוקולד.","en":"I am hungry, I want chocolate.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"את שותָה מיץ ואני קורא עיתון.","en":"You are drinking juice and I am reading a newspaper.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"רע":"bad / bad (masculine singular)","מיץ":"a glass of juice / juice","עוף":"a chicken / chicken, fowl, poultry (food)","מתוק":"sweet / sweet (masculine singular)","תפוז":"an orange / orange / orange (fruit)","חמוץ":"sour / sour (masculine singular)","עצוב":"sad / sad (masculine singular)","תפוח":"an apple / apple","אפרסק":"a peach / peach","עיתון":"a newspaper / newspaper","התפוח":"the apple / the apple is","זה":"it / it is / it's","כיף":"fun","הספר":"the book","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","קורא":"is reading / read / reading","ספר":"a book / book / tell! (story) (masculine singular)","היא":"her / it / she","קוראת":"is reading / read / reading","הילד":"the boy / the boy is / the kid","הכלב":"the dog","יפֶה":"beautiful / beautiful (feminine singular) / handsome","כן":"yes","האוכל":"the food","טעים":"delicious / tasty / tasty (masculine singular)","האישה":"the woman / the woman is","הילדה":"the girl / the girl is","הוא":"(he) is / (it) is / he","בוס":"boss","טוב":"alright / good / ok","אוכל":"eat / eating / eats","או":"or","עוגה":"a cake / cake","רוצֶה":"want / wants / would like","ילד":"boy","מים":"water","שותֶה":"drink / drinking / drinks","אתה":"you / you are / you (masculine singular)","הגבר":"the man / the man is","לא":"aren't / didn't / do not","אוכלת":"are eating / eating / is eating","רוצָה":"want / wants / would like","אופֶה":"bakes (masculine singular) / bakes (feminine singular)","רואָה":"is seeing / see / sees","זאת":"it is (feminine) / that / that is (feminine)","תקופה":"period, era / season","יפָה":"beautiful / beautiful (feminine singular) / handsome","לחם":"bread","חלב":"milk","ואני":"and I / and I am","שמח":"happy (masculine singular) / happy","את":"it / that / the fruit","גג":"roof","בקבוק":"bottle","גבר":"a man / man","שותָה":"drink / drinking / drinks","גרמניה":"Germany","מדינה":"country, state","טעימה":"tasty (feminine singular)","רואֶה":"is seeing / see / sees","לברוח":"escape, run away / to run away, escape","רעב":"hungry (masculine singular)","שוקולד":"chocolate"},"words":[{"he":"הוא","en":"he","alt":["(he) is","(it) is","him"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hu"},{"he":"רוצֶה","en":"want","alt":["wants","would like"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"rotzeh"},{"he":"טעים","en":"tasty","alt":["delicious"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ta'im"},{"he":"תפוח","en":"apple","alt":["an apple"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tapuakh"},{"he":"הילדה","en":"the girl","alt":["the girl is"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"תפוז","en":"orange","alt":["an orange"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"tapuz"},{"he":"עוגה","en":"cake","alt":["a cake"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ugah"},{"he":"ואני","en":"and I","alt":["and I am"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"התפוח","en":"the apple","alt":["the apple is"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"מתוק","en":"sweet (masculine singular)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"matok"},{"he":"הספר","en":"the book","alt":[],"from":"skill"},{"he":"ספר","en":"book","alt":["a book"],"from":"skill","tr":"sefer"},{"he":"עוף","en":"chicken, fowl, poultry (food)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"of"},{"he":"קורא","en":"read","alt":["is reading","reading"],"from":"skill","tr":"kore"},{"he":"חמוץ","en":"sour (masculine singular)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"khamutz"},{"he":"מיץ","en":"juice","alt":["a glass of juice"],"from":"skill","tr":"mitz"},{"he":"קוראת","en":"is reading","alt":["read","reading"],"from":"skill","tr":"koret"},{"he":"עיתון","en":"newspaper","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"iton"},{"he":"אפרסק","en":"peach","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"afarsek"},{"he":"כיף","en":"fun","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"keif"},{"he":"עצוב","en":"sad (masculine singular)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"atzuv"},{"he":"יפֶה","en":"nice","alt":["beautiful (masculine singular)","pretty"],"from":"skill","tr":"yafeh"},{"he":"רע","en":"bad (masculine singular)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ra"},{"he":"טוב","en":"ok","alt":["alright","good","well"],"from":"skill","tr":"tov"},{"he":"אוכלת","en":"eating","alt":["is eating","are eating"],"from":"phrase","tr":"okhelet"},{"he":"הילד","en":"the boy","alt":["the boy is","the kid"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"לא","en":"doesn't","alt":["didn't","does not"],"from":"phrase","tr":"lo"},{"he":"מים","en":"water","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"mayim"}],"lexemes":["רוצֶה","מתוק","עוגה","הספר","התפוח","ספר","תפוח","רוצָה","עוף","קורא","חמוץ","התפוז","מיץ","קוראת","תפוז","עיתון","אפרסק","כיף","עצוב","טעים","יפֶה","רע","טוב"],"tips":"NEW USERS AND PEOPLE NEW TO HEBREW: See [here](https://duolinguists.wordpress.com/typing-in-hebrew-learning-alef-bet-for-beginners/) for quick instructions on **typing** and **learning to read** Hebrew.\n\nHere is the table of Hebrew letters again for reference:\n\n(Letters in blue are taught in this skill)\n\n(Letters in green were taught in former skills)\n\nName|Letter|Ending form|IPA|English example\n---|---|---|---|---\nAleph |א| |/ʔ/|**uh** (usually silent or similar to the letter \"a\" in English: a placeholder for vowels)**\nBet |ב| |/b/*,/v/|bet, vet\nGimel|ג| |/g/|**g**o\nDalet|ד| |/d/|**d**og\nHey|ה| |/h/|**h**en (often silent in modern colloquial speech)\nVav|ו| |/v/|**v**et\nZayin|ז| |/z/|**z**oo\nChet|ח| |/X/|lo**ch**\nTet|ט| |/t/| **t**en\nYod|י| |/j/|**y**es\nKaf|כ|ך|/k/*, /X/|**c**at, lo**ch**\nLamed|ל| |/l/|**l**og\nMem|מ|ם|/m/|**m**an\nNun|נ|ן|/n/|**n**o\nSamekh|ס| |/s/|**s**ee\nAyin|ע| |/ʔ/, /ʕ/|**uh** |identical to א for most modern native Hebrew speakers\nPei|פ|ף|/p/*,/f/|**p**ay, **f**ool\nTsadi|צ|ץ|/ts/|ca**ts**\nQof|ק| |/k/|**c**at\nResh|ר| |/ʁ/|**r**un (similar to the French r)\nShin|ש| |/ʃ/,/s/|**sh**e, **s**ee\nTav|ת| |/t/|**t**ap\n\n*These sounds are pronounced only when the letter is at the beginning of the word or at the beginning of a syllable. Otherwise, the other sound will be the one that is pronounced.\n\n**A common example for the use of \"א\" as a silent letter is the word: לא (/lo/) - which means \"no\".\n\n-----------\n***Ktiv malé: \"Full Spelling\"***\n-----------\n\nIn modern Hebrew we usually don't use vowel dots (nikud), which is why we will learn to read without them. Ktiv malé (\"full spelling\") is a way of writing which helps us to do so.\n\nIn *ktiv male* we use letters to replace some of the nikud, so in fact, it's not strictly true that Hebrew is written without vowels. \n\nLetter| IPA | English example | Hebrew example\n---|---|---|---\nו |o| l**o**g | א**ו**רז (**ó**rez - rice)\nו |u| z**oo** | ה**ו**א (h**u** - he is)\nי |e| b**e**d | ה**י**שג (h**é**seg - accomplishment)\nי |i| b**ee**p | ה**י**א (h**ee** - she is)\nא,ה,ע| a|r**a**g| ר**ע** (r**a** - bad)\nא,ה,ע| e|b**e**d|קור**א** (kor**é** - reads)\n\nThere are also a few guidelines you can use to help you:\n\n1.When a word ends with the letter \"ח\", the end is always pronounced as \"akh\" (*\"aX\"*).\n\n>\n- רוּ**ח** (rú**akh** - wind)\n- מוֹ**ח**(mó**akh** - brain)\n- שי**ח** (sí**akh** - bush/conversation)\n- רי**ח** (ré'**akh** - smell)\n- פר**ח** (pér**akh** - flower)\n- תפוּ**ח** (tapú**akh** - apple)\n\n2.When a word ends with the letter \"ע\", the end is always pronounced as \"a\" (*\"ʔa\"*, *\"ʕa\"*)\n\n>\n- שומ**ע** (shomé**a** - hears)\n- כוב**ע** (kóv*a** - a hat)\n- אצב**ע** (étsb**a** - a finger)\n- קרק**ע** (kark**á** - ground)\n\n3.In some words, we use the diphthong \"יי\" for \"ai\", \"ey\" and \"ya\":\n\n>\n- היי (hey - hey)\n- ביי (bai - bye)\n- יין (yain - wine)\n\n4.When we want to pronounce the sound \"v\" we double the letter ו (vav) - since when we are not using nikud, the letter ו is used to indicate when there is a vowel, \"o\" or \"u\":\n\n>\n- אוויר (avír - air)\n- מוותר (mevatér - gives up)\n- מותר (mutár - allowed)\n\n**Note:** when the letter ו appears in the beginning of the word there is no need to double it - it will nearly always be \"v\". Eg. ורוד varód (pink)\n\n5.When a word ends with the combination \"יו\", it will mostly be pronounced as \"av\".\n\n>\n- עכש**יו** (akhsh**áv**)\n- על**יו** (al**áv**)"}